    "body": "For the little it's worth, LGTM now.\r\n\r\nI just wonder if we should have WPTests for this?\r\nYou said in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9824 that the fact it's a task is visible through the `longtask-timing` API, and we can probably add a small test that the timestamp is correctly updated after a long task (testing for the race-condition case), but maybe it's already there, I must admit I didn't check yet.\r\nWDYT?\r\n",
